5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I need to know why the car is never ready when I need it.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,The arranging takes longer than the driving. I want to see the time cost.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,We assume shares are equal. I need to know what that actually means.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,We are fighting over the car now. I want to know why groups sour.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I have no idea what we spent last year. I need the real numbers.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Kenji, if we don't know the cost, how do we know the state?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, the state is a symptom. The time is the disease.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, time is money, but so is the fuel you burn.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, money is fine. The silence is the problem.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, silence is expensive. I want to see the receipts.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will look at the handover state and the weekly trips.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,I will check the diary hours and the heavy use weeks.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will look at the tax papers and the mechanic's remarks.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will check the other households and the spell of checking figures.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will look at the fuel receipts and the trial of recording runs.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
