35,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The car is often empty or dirty when I get it.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,Saturdays are triple the work of Tuesdays. The diary proves it.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The fixed costs are high, and short runs kill the brakes.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,Other groups failed because they had to ask favours constantly.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,Two people bought most of the fuel. The tracking took an hour a week.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Kenji, if tracking takes an hour, who does it?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, if I track it, I am the one apologising.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, the fixed costs are 280,000 yen. That is a lot.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, if we check figures, we feel accused.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, if we don't check, we guess. Guessing is worse.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,I need a system where the car is ready without asking.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,I need a system where I don't have to manage the chaos.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,I need a system that accounts for the wear and tear.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,I need a system that doesn't make us feel like strangers.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,I need a system that shows who actually drives.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
