60,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Option A gives me my days. I don't have to ask.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,May,,Option C lets me book only when I need it. No idle time.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Servas,,Option B puts the burden on one person. That is unfair.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Takumi,,Option A feels rigid. Option C feels like a business.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Kenji,,Option C tracks distance. That matches my need for real figures.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, if I book, I still have to wait for the car.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, if you have a fixed day, you hold it even if you don't use it.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, distance is fair, but who records it?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, if we record it, we start checking each other again.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, we can use the app. It does the checking for us.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I prefer A. It guarantees my morning.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,May,,I prefer C. It stops the evenings of arranging.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Servas,,I prefer C. It accounts for the actual use.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Takumi,,I prefer A. It stops the favour-asking.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I prefer C. It gives me the data I need.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
